  "description": "Installation of 2m high front boundary wall with sliding entrance gate",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;The proposed front boundary wall and sliding entrance gate,\r\nby reason of its solid appearance, inappropriate brick design and it&#x27;s height, appears as an incongruous, bulky and visually obtrusive\r\naddition to the street scene given its prominent position on the junction of Kings\r\nRoad and Malvern Avenue. The proposal&amp;nbsp; also conflicts with the prevailing pattern of\r\ndevelopment and is therefore contrary to the high quality design aspirations of\r\nthe National Planning Policy Framework (2024), and D3 (D.1 and D.11) of The\r\nLondon Plan (2021), Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1\r\nof the Development Management Policies Local Plan 2013 and Policy GR1 of the Draft\r\nHarrow Local Plan 2021-2044.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
